+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+On a 5,000-record store, the measured `SessionStart` hook cost was **11.9 ms
+p50** before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path. After that
+change, the measured cost was **1.05 ms p50**.
+
+The same change also introduced the trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter and
+the `CHECK (length(body) <= 2000)` constraint. Because these changes were
+measured together, the before/after result does not isolate the contribution of
+any one of them.
